{"seq":2,"slug":"github-actions-deep-dive","title":"GitHub Actions 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions-deep-dive","wordCount":771,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"github-actions-深入\">GitHub Actions 深入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GitHub Actions 是 GitHub 原生的 CI/CD 平台，工作流由 <code>.github/workflows/</code> 下的 YAML 定义，呈三层结构：<strong>workflow</strong>（由 <code>on</code> 触发）→ <strong>job</strong>（由 <code>needs</code> 编排依赖）→ <strong>step</strong>（具体执行单元）。</p>\n<p>在此结构之上有四项关键机制：<code>strategy.matrix</code> 实现多维度并行测试；<code>actions/cache</code> 与 artifact 在运行间复用依赖、在 Job 间传递产物；<code>docker/build-push-action</code> 完成镜像构建与推送；Secrets 与 OIDC 管理敏感凭证。<code>permissions</code> 字段则限定 <code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code> 的权限边界。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流基础结构\">工作流基础结构</h2><p>GitHub Actions 是 GitHub 原生的 CI/CD 平台，通过 YAML 文件定义自动化工作流。工作流文件存储在仓库的 <code>.github/workflows/</code> 目录中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI Pipeline&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: read&#10;  packages: write&#10;&#10;env:&#10;  NODE_VERSION: &#39;20&#39;&#10;  REGISTRY: ghcr.io&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  ci:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          version: 9&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm run lint&#10;      - run: pnpm run typecheck&#10;      - run: pnpm test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  NODE_VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'20'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  REGISTRY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">     