typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm test</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作流组件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>工作流名称</td>\n<td>CI Pipeline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>on</td>\n<td>触发条件</td>\n<td>push, pull_request</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>permissions</td>\n<td>GITHUB_TOKEN 权限</td>\n<td>contents: read</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>env</td>\n<td>工作流级环境变量</td>\n<td>NODE_VERSION: &quot;20&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jobs</td>\n<td>作业定义</td>\n<td>ci, build, deploy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>steps</td>\n<td>作业中的步骤</td>\n<td>checkout, test, build</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    TRIGGER[触发事件] --&gt; WF[Workflow]&#10;    WF --&gt; JOB1[Job 1: CI]&#10;    WF --&gt; JOB2[Job 2: Build]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; S1[Step: checkout]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; S2[Step: install]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; S3[Step: test]&#10;    JOB2 --&gt; S4[Step: docker build]&#10;    JOB2 --&gt; S5[Step: push]\">graph TD\n    TRIGGER[触发事件] --&gt; WF[Workflow]\n    WF --&gt; JOB1[Job 1: CI]\n    WF --&gt; JOB2[Job 2: Build]\n    JOB1 --&gt; S1[Step: checkout]\n    JOB1 --&gt; S2[Step: install]\n    JOB1 --&gt; S3[Step: test]\n    JOB2 --&gt; S4[Step: docker build]\n    JOB2 --&gt; S5[Step: push]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"作业编排\">作业编排</h2><p>多个 Job 之间可以定义依赖关系，实现并行执行和条件执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  lint:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm run lint&#10;&#10;  test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        node-version: [18, 20, 22]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm test&#10;&#10;  build:&#10;    needs: [lint, test]&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm run build&#10;&#10;  deploy:&#10;    needs: build&#10;    if: github.ref == &#39;refs/heads/main&#39;&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    environment: production&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: echo &quot;Deploying to production&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"