ntents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/setup-buildx-action@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/login-action@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          username</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.actor }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/metadata-action@v5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">meta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          images</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io/${{ github.repository }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            type=semver,pattern={{version}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            type=semver,pattern={{major}}.{{minor}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            type=sha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/build-push-action@v6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.event_name != 'pull_request' }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.meta.outputs.tags }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.meta.outputs.labels }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache-from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type=gha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache-to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type=gha,mode=max</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>docker/setup-buildx-action</td>\n<td>配置 BuildKit 构建器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker/login-action</td>\n<td>登录镜像仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker/metadata-action</td>\n<td>自动生成标签和标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker/build-push-action</td>\n<td>构建并推送镜像</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>cache-from: type=gha</code> 和 <code>cache-to: type=gha,mode=max</code> 可以利用 GitHub Actions 的缓存存储 Docker 层缓存，大幅加速后续构建。<code>mode=max</code> 会缓存所有中间层，而不仅仅是最终镜像的层。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"secrets-与安全\">Secrets 与安全</h2><p>安全地管理 CI/CD 中的敏感数据是至关重要的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全机制</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>配置位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Repository Secrets</td>\n<td>仓库级密钥</td>\n<td>Settings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Environment Secrets</td>\n<td>环境级密钥</td>\n<td>Environments</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OIDC</td>\n<td>无密钥的云平台认证</td>\n<td>云平台配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批保护</td>\n<td>部署前人工审批</td>\n<td>Environments</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支保护</td>\n<td>限制可触发的分支</td>\n<td>Branch rules</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((GitHub Actions 深入))&#10;    工作流结构&#10;      on 触发&#10;      jobs 作业&#10;      steps 步骤&#10;    作业编排&#10;      needs 依赖&#10;      matrix 矩阵&#10;      if 条件&#10;      environment 环境&#10;    缓存与制品&#10;      actions/cache&#10;      upload/download artifact&#10;      Docker 层缓存&#10;    镜像构建&#10;      BuildKit&#10;      metadata-action&#10;      自动标签&#10;    安全管理&#10;      Secrets&#10;      OIDC&#10;      环境审批\">mindmap\n  root((GitHub Actions 深入))\n    工作流结构\n      on 触发\n      jobs 作业\n      steps 步骤\n    作业编排\n      needs 依赖\n      matrix 矩阵\n      if 条件\n      environment 环境\n    缓存与制品\n      actions/cache\n      upload/download artifact\n      Docker 层缓存\n    镜像构建\n      BuildKit\n      metadata-action\n      自动标签\n    安全管理\n      Secrets\n      OIDC\n      环境审批</pre><ul>\n<li>GitHub Actions 工作流由 <code>on</code>（触发）、<code>jobs</code>（作业）和 <code>steps</code>（步骤）三层结构组成。</li>\n<li><code>needs</code> 定义作业依赖，<code>matrix</code> 实现多维度并行测试，<code>if</code> 支持条件执行。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>actions/cache</code> 缓存依赖，<code>upload/download-artifact</code> 在 Job 间传递构建产物。</li>\n<li>Docker 镜像构建推荐使用 <code>docker/build-push-action</code> 配合 GHA 层缓存加速构建。</li>\n<li>敏感数据通过 Repository/Environment Secrets 管理，生产环境启用审批保护。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GitHub Actions 深入","id":"github-actions-深入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流基础结构","id":"工作流基础结构"},{"level":2,"text":"作业编排","id":"作业编排"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存与制品","id":"缓存与制品"},{"level":2,"text":"Docker 镜像构建与推送","id":"docker-镜像构建与推送"},{"level":2,"text":"Secrets 与安全","id":"secrets-与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流水线设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-design-patterns"},"next":{"title":"制品与镜像仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/artifact-and-registry"}}